  <item>
    <title>诈骗局中局</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6651d4ef4efbc0c3dcfbebb3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6651d4ef4efbc0c3dcfbebb3</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 25 May 2024 12:09:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>温馨提示：本期播客食用方法不建议在睡前听哦！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>在被骗漩涡中拼命寻找出路，真真假假我一时分不清楚。</span></p><span></span><p><span>记得第一次相见你一脸冷酷，相处久了你就原形毕露。</span></p><span></span><p><span>恋爱时我的真心被狠狠辜负，你设下陷阱的罪行不可饶恕。</span></p><span></span><p><span>守住金币不误入歧途，别等分文不剩才悔不当初。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你走的每一步都算数 何必自欺欺人装糊涂。</span></p><span></span><p><span>心怀不轨的计划如同迷雾，因为信任让我一步步陷入。</span></p><span></span><p><span>善意的谎言是你习惯的话术，造成的遗憾谁来弥补。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们要学会自我保护，多留心眼才能稳稳幸福！</span></p><span></span><p><span>听明枪暗箭播客 全都暴富！！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间分布：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">00:35</a> &nbsp;经费上来了！姐们也请得起嘉宾了！！(˶╹ꇴ╹˶)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">02:03</a> &nbsp;好吧～其实不是经费上来了，是手段上来了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="190">03:10</a> &nbsp;诈骗局中局！Action！！꒰ঌ( ⌯' '⌯)໒꒱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="305">05:05</a> &nbsp;诈骗清单———「万」 初识假象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">05:15</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;我认识的是同一个湘湘吗？？！！？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="363">06:03</a> &nbsp;土豆一气之下变成“炸”土豆 &nbsp;(*¯︶¯*)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="406">06:46</a> &nbsp;学霸是我对晨晨最大的误解！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="447">07:27</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;“红晨黄绿”cp往事追忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="567">09:27</a> &nbsp;诈骗清单———「兔」恋爱陷阱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="574">09:34</a> 这个谐音梗上大分！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="613">10:13</a> &nbsp;四天时间陷阱都来不及设！！！(◎_◎;)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="673">11:13</a> &nbsp;湘姐说：“再问身高就不礼貌了。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="722">12:02</a> &nbsp;触发锦囊关卡！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="798">13:18</a> 诈骗清单———「思瑞」 金币豆诈骗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="816">13:36</a> &nbsp;为青春哐哐买单</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="888">14:48</a> &nbsp;是兄弟，就帮我砍一刀！(*￣3￣)╭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="921">15:21</a> &nbsp;骗我就得了，骗家人忍不了一点！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="964">16:04</a> &nbsp;诈骗清单———「佛哦」 自欺欺人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="968">16:08</a> &nbsp;一旦开始学习，一切都变有趣起来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1013">16:53</a> &nbsp;装进书包等于装进脑子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1071">17:51</a> &nbsp;触发锦囊关卡2！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1166">19:26</a> &nbsp;诈骗清单———「飞哎无」信任的小船漏水了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1171">19:31</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;过期的不仅是食物也是我们之间的感情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1295">21:35</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;我们之间的信任只价值一分钱 (´･Д･)」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1385">23:05</a> &nbsp;果子再等一会都熟了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1526">25:26</a> &nbsp;诈骗清单———「丝科丝」善意的谎言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1538">25:38</a> &nbsp;一首《你不是真正的快乐》送给璐璐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1598">26:38</a> &nbsp;谎言虽善 终成遗憾…</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1692">28:12</a> &nbsp;头脑风暴！推理排序ing</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1826">30:26</a> &nbsp;正确答案揭晓 Amazing! Unbelievable!!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1853">30:53</a> &nbsp;滚蛋吧！坏蛋！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2058">34:18</a> &nbsp;小坏蛋现身引发众怒！现场一片混乱%@¥&amp;%</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2137">35:37</a> &nbsp;防诈app已下！你们可长点心吧！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkvD05JoVHeVY6vLWGvcZtd779dD.m4a" length="36307451" type="audio/mp4"/>
