  <item>
    <title>寻缘相亲角，给我一大脚！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6638d8aa48dbc98b8965b852</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6638d8aa48dbc98b8965b852</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 06 May 2024 13:18:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>以为来到了鹊桥，幻想和缘分拥抱。</span></p><span></span><p><span>奈何大爷大妈的吐槽，犹如长矛和刺刀。</span></p><span></span><p><span>体制带编最讨好，有房有车也不能少。</span></p><span></span><p><span>学历太高也苦恼，太过优秀也被挑。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你的要求别太高，小心将来没人要。</span></p><span></span><p><span>听到这些我只想尖叫！你的要求我一个也达不到！</span></p><span></span><p><span>条条框框未免太过俗套，爱情来了什么都抵挡不了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>明枪暗箭播客，听了都说好！</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="44">00:44</a> &nbsp;愿逆风如解意，容易莫摧残。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> &nbsp;明枪暗箭小剧场——月老你快显显灵吧！我不想再去相亲了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="190">03:10</a> &nbsp;冒险开始！勇闯相亲角ing！(^O^)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="215">03:35</a> &nbsp;《桃花朵朵开》有爱你就来！Action！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="228">03:48</a> &nbsp;“携一人之手，陪你沐硒水长流”【顺天·明月湾】与您相约。（祝贺：我们接到广子啦啦啦啦啦~~~）(✪▽✪)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="245">04:05</a> &nbsp;一号女嘉宾——豆子 // 能否被丘比特的爱情之箭精准射中呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">04:40</a> 【来自相亲角的现场报道】美女主播也抵不住大爷们的七嘴八舌(=_=)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="350">05:50</a> &nbsp;大爷你变了，你在直播间里不是这样的！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="401">06:41</a> 我猜大爷的初中生物一定没及格。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="454">07:34</a> &nbsp;豆子out：我再也不去相亲角了！！！(T ^ T)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="466">07:46</a> &nbsp;二号女嘉宾——晨晨 // 会有一个能和她知冷暖，同进退的良缘出现吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="495">08:15</a> 【来自相亲角的现场报道】海归女一心返乡，大爷恼羞成怒(º﹃º&nbsp;)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="581">09:41</a> *嫁鸡随鸡，嫁狗随狗* @%##**能不能消失啊啊啊！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="649">10:49</a> 来相个亲，兄弟姐妹也无辜躺枪。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="726">12:06</a> 晨晨out：长沙相亲角应该还有我的身影。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="741">12:21</a> 三号女嘉宾——湘湘 // 让我们期待水晶鞋女孩，是否能在相亲角可以迎来她的白马王子？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="772">12:52</a> 【来自相亲角的现场报道】一编在手，天下我有，女教师轻松拿捏住了〜(￣▽￣〜)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="896">14:56</a> 你有没有一米六，有吗？有吗？有吗？有吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="922">15:22</a> 要求刚说出口就速速pass！！！&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1009">16:49</a> 湘湘out：香饽饽找不到自己的香饽饽。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1028">17:08</a> 四号女嘉宾——璐璐 // 不知道她会在相亲角中擦出怎样的爱情火花？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1062">17:42</a> 【来自相亲角的现场报道】大爷大妈竟成求学路上的拦路虎(*´ο`*)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1174">19:34</a> 没想到！兴趣爱好还是我的减分项！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1211">20:11</a> “男人三十一枝花，女人三十豆腐渣”@#%*@这是什么鬼俗话！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1281">21:21</a> 相亲连带相父母 （还带这样的......&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1317">21:57</a> &nbsp;璐璐out：一盆盆冷水泼向我，根本不管我的死活！！！(￣へ￣)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1339">22:19</a> 全部灭灯，牵手失败！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1354">22:34</a> 勇闯相亲后感触颇多，哔哔赖赖ing~~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1472">24:32</a> 希望大家在爱的转角，遇见你的心动嘉宾~~ 【评论区化身许愿池】＼(^▽^)／！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1532">25:32</a> 换个月老试试看？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目里的人物角色皆为设定，谈论的观点和话题仅代表我们四位主播个人立场，如果有不同想法，欢迎大家友好地在评论区与我们一起讨论吧~~~</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/longH3Oq1O6xPp8e31PT6eqmbomL.m4a" length="25911123" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:26:42</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu7bWuEfkFNaO7mmMU5MPOu0Q04g.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>闪开！我爸妈才是第一！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6619631948c40e2fb0f7aa6e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6619631948c40e2fb0f7aa6e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 14 Apr 2024 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>做你们的小孩，幸福的同时也很无奈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你以为最好的安排 ，却不是我想要的未来。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你的视线无处不在，不能呼吸到无法忍耐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>疼爱太多我也难以承载，像枷锁一样挣脱不开。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你的爱像一块盾牌，阻挡了伤害也成为了阻碍。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们都应该明白，尊重沟通才是最好的爱。</span></p><span></span><p><span>明枪暗箭播客，值得你的信赖！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="36">00:36</a> &nbsp;一系列操作下来，亲妈都害怕 (　ﾟ皿ﾟ)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="124">02:04</a> &nbsp;明枪暗箭小剧场——父母的比较什么时候是个头啊！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="212">03:32</a> &nbsp;角色大反转！比赛正式开始！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="254">04:14</a> &nbsp;热烈欢迎！有请各家庭参赛选手入场 (✪▽✪)♪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="296">04:56</a> &nbsp;*最佳松弛奖* 谁与争锋...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="305">05:05</a> &nbsp;霸总也要补作业...？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="352">05:52</a> &nbsp;刚踏入幼儿园，我就回不去了（π_π）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="384">06:24</a> &nbsp;“警察叔叔，我要找妈妈。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="443">07:23</a> &nbsp;坤总开大：阔别三月，精装变毛坯。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="556">09:16</a> &nbsp;现场连线——坤总拿下最佳松弛奖项目，并表示继续发扬！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="625">10:25</a> &nbsp;*最佳冷漠奖* 谁将...夺得头筹...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="631">10:31</a> &nbsp;那一晚 机场的风格外冷 (｡•́︿•̀｡)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="666">11:06</a> &nbsp;最熟悉的陌生人——我和我的父亲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="796">13:16</a> &nbsp;现场连线——王二叔实至名归最佳冷漠奖，并表示本次连线有点耽误工作。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="886">14:46</a> &nbsp;*独裁专制奖* 鹿死谁手？？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="892">14:52</a> &nbsp;晨晨勇敢飞，妈妈紧紧紧紧紧相随。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1003">16:43</a> &nbsp;现场连线——陈华阿姨摘得桂冠，并质疑组委会评定. -_-||</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1105">18:25</a> &nbsp;*最佳监控奖*究竟是哪位选手脱颖而出...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1112">18:32</a> &nbsp;丹丹阿姨开启上帝视角。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">20:30</a> 现场连线——丹丹阿姨当之无愧最佳监控奖，并表示生活不停，监控不止。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1340">22:20</a> 谁来给我们的父母拉小群！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1403">23:23</a> 尊重和爱再加上沟通，才是王炸！٩(๑´0`๑)۶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1426">23:46</a> 萍姐因未入围本次大赛进行抗议，坤总表示：松弛一点~</span></p>]]></description>
