  <item>
    <title>我的“垃圾”朋友们</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/660958d82d9eae5d0a29d9ea</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">660958d82d9eae5d0a29d9ea</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 31 Mar 2024 12:36:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>友情这场游戏我输得好惨，你口中的我如此不堪。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我的底线你一次次冒犯，你的话语我听着心寒。</span></p><span></span><p><span>有福你同享有难不同担，你的借口每次都好烂。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我付出的真情实感，你索取的理所当然。</span></p><span></span><p><span>收起你的野蛮 ，放下你的身段，现在我们一拍两散。</span></p><span></span><p><span>垃圾朋友 请你滚蛋！</span></p><span></span><p><span>明枪暗箭播客 就差你的点赞！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="64">01:04</a> 四人友谊就我一人单向奔赴？？？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="93">01:33</a> 小剧场！我的好朋友，你就放过我吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="148">02:28</a> 阿巴阿巴法国设计师..阿巴阿巴身材可好了...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="177">02:57</a> 垃圾都没你垃圾，赶紧扔掉真！垃！圾！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="214">03:34</a> 震惊！讨人厌榜首！！竟是...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="242">04:02</a> 啊！这里应该不能随便摸吧 d(ŐдŐ๑)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="303">05:03</a> 重生之我在初中当丫鬟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="394">06:34</a> &nbsp;XXX竟屈居第二！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="448">07:28</a> 同样的群建两个 知道真相的我眼泪掉下来 (┯_┯)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="494">08:14</a> 失去了面包！也失去了友情！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="571">09:31</a> 有福一起享，有难你来挡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="622">10:22</a> 讨人厌第三名花落谁家？？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="653">10:53</a> 来，跟我一起读“Prada”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="748">12:28</a> 出门在外身份是自己给的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="910">15:10</a> 悬念揭晓...荣获第四的是....</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="936">15:36</a> 你是我追梦路上的教导主任</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="991">16:31</a> 没有啊..不是啊...我不要你觉得，我要我觉得 (º﹃º )</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1064">17:44</a> ！！注意！！朋友圈垃圾太多请及时清理！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1150">19:10</a> 下播续火花！火花灭！友情断！ヽ(‘⌒´メ)ノ</span></p>]]></description>
