  <item>
    <title>小组！gun！作业！gun！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65f6d2196764957079d371dc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65f6d2196764957079d371dc</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 17 Mar 2024 11:20:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>分组时你自己往上凑，期末却让我一人抠破了头。</span></p><span></span><p><span>当时的约定拉勾，让我现在成了小丑。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我一直对小组群里的消息苦苦守候，殊不知她和她的对象在电影院里牵着小手。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这里我暂且不说某某某，你的行为令我作呕。</span></p><span></span><p><span>明枪暗箭播客，你值得拥有。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="56">00:56</a> 四位美女 大学三年首次合体亮相</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="113">01:53</a> 明枪暗箭小剧场 四年！整整四年的小组作业！你知道我是怎么过来的嘛！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="185">03:05</a> @#￥%*&amp;*##*气死人.....</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="243">04:03</a> 交换半年——我的组员甲方爸爸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="328">05:28</a> 多人小组上演“消失的他们”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="436">07:16</a> 老师！组长说：“你们的平时分我说了算！”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="497">08:17</a> 通识课的背刺来得又快又狠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="519">08:39</a> call back 小剧场 主角竟然是....</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="616">10:16</a> &nbsp;call back 小剧场 again ...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="681">11:21</a> 游泳健将竟在我组~~别游了快回来！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="760">12:40</a> 乖乖~你就告诉我 你擅长些啥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="970">16:10</a> &nbsp;那你这样说的话 这小组长我就当定了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1077">17:57</a> &nbsp;1+1=2 ??? 漏！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1154">19:14</a> &nbsp;爽文剧本——当老师拥有上帝视角</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1223">20:23</a> &nbsp;COS林老师的到点下班</span></p>]]></description>
